{
  "version": 1,
  "launch": {
    "command": "npm",
    "args": [
      "start",
      "--",
      "--data-dir",
      "{dataDir}",
      "--width",
      "{width}",
      "--height",
      "{height}",
      "--remote-debugging-port={port}"
    ],
    "cwd": "."
  },
  "mainWindow": {
    "title": "层界 NEST · Nested OS",
    "urlPattern": "file://*/dist/index.html"
  },
  "connection": {
    "type": "chrome-devtools-protocol",
    "port": 19156,
    "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:{port}",
    "context": "主窗口的 file:// 渲染页面；外部网页位于 Electron webview 独立目标中"
  },
  "fixtures": {
    "outer": {
      "workbook": "/Demo/sample.sheet",
      "chartRange": "A1:D4",
      "helicopter": "/Demo/helicopter-24.scene",
      "minimalScene": "/Demo/minimal.scene",
      "documents": "/Documents",
      "kernel": "/System/kernel.nx",
      "childKernelPattern": "/System/{childId}.kernel.nx",
      "compiler": "/System/compiler.nx",
      "flightController": "/Programs/flight-control.nx",
      "programs": "/Programs"
    },
    "inner": {
      "helicopter": "/Demo/helicopter-24.scene",
      "minimalScene": "/Demo/minimal.scene",
      "documents": "/Documents",
      "kernelTemplate": "/System/kernel.nx",
      "ownKernelInParent": "/System/{systemId}.kernel.nx",
      "compiler": "/System/compiler.nx",
      "flightController": "/Programs/flight-control.nx",
      "desktop": "/System/desktop.nx",
      "player": "/System/player.nx",
      "chart": "/System/chart.nx",
      "files": "/System/files.nx"
    }
  },
  "interface": {
    "ready": "await window.bench.ready()",
    "reset": "await window.bench.reset()",
    "inspect": "await window.bench.inspect()",
    "version": "window.bench.version"
  },
  "notes": [
    "使用窗口容器 data-system-id + data-window-id 限定选择器；同层可以打开多个同类应用。",
    "桌面图标双击打开，开始菜单规范入口为单击。系统空间是递归管理入口。",
    "投送窗口的 app-id 为 projection，来源由 data-source-system-id/window-id/app-id 标注。",
    "播放器 player-open 是场景文件选择框；拖动 player-seek，或使用 aria-label=跳转到时间秒 的数值框精确跳转。",
    "chart-source 选择已打开的根工作簿，chart-series 使用逗号分隔的列字母，例如 B,D。",
    "无须本地 HTTP 服务；npm start 自动构建并启动 Electron。数据仅保存到传入的 data-dir。"
  ]
}